[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2305345)[0m - The stove is typically on the right side of the sink (again, from the perspective of someone standing in front of the refrigerator).
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2305345)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2305345)[0m From this layout, with the person facing the refrigerator:
