[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2305345)[0m - The **stove** is to the **right** (positive x-axis).
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2305345)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2305345)[0m So, the **stove is to the front-right** (positive x-axis and positive y-axis).
